Project Title: nfl_draft_analysis_1998_2015.ipynb
Description: Analyzing NFL drafting data from 1998-2015 reviewing location, region, age, income, and other details of the
draftees. Includes analysis and visualizations. Data imported from data_import includes superbowl data of draftees, 
nfl draft data, and state gdp.
Requirements:
Must have python packages-
pandas
numpy
matplotlib.pyplot
sqlite3
csv
sqlalchemy
Must also have ability to open Jupyter notebooks and Excel installed.
Quick Start: Click on .ipynb file to open, update folder location to point to where your dat_import is and run in your notebook.
